<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Multi-Turn Interaction on CoMLRL</title><link>/docs/multi-turn/</link><description>Recent content in Multi-Turn Interaction on CoMLRL</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><copyright>© {year} OpenMLRL. All rights reserved.</copyright><atom:link href="/docs/multi-turn/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Multi-Turn Algorithm</title><link>/docs/multi-turn/algorithm/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/multi-turn/algorithm/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Many complex problems require more than one turn to solve. LLM agents interact with the environment to obtain useful feedback from other models or tools in the system.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="multi-turn-magrpo"&gt;Multi-Turn MAGRPO&lt;a class="anchor" href="#multi-turn-magrpo"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Multi-turn MAGRPO builds a rollout tree whose branches represent different joint responses (&lt;a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.05183"&gt;TreeRPO&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="docs-rollout" data-rollout data-algorithm-flow data-diagram="joint-tree" data-direction="down" aria-labelledby="rollout-joint-tree-0-title"&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption class="docs-rollout-caption"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="docs-rollout-title" id="rollout-joint-tree-0-title"&gt;Joint rollout tree&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="docs-rollout-description docs-sr-only" id="rollout-joint-tree-0-description"&gt;Joint observations and actions branch into independent rollouts.&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="docs-rollout-stage"&gt;&lt;svg role="img" aria-labelledby="rollout-joint-tree-0-title rollout-joint-tree-0-description" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="algorithm-flow" width="720" height="280" viewBox="0 0 720 280" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle"&gt;&#10; &lt;title&gt;Joint responses branch into independent rollouts&lt;/title&gt;&#10; &lt;defs&gt;&#10; &lt;marker id="rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-purple" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"&gt;&lt;path d="m2 2 5 3-5 3" fill="none" stroke="var(--af-purple, #7861b2)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&#10; &lt;marker id="rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-teal" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"&gt;&lt;path d="m2 2 5 3-5 3" fill="none" stroke="var(--af-teal, #438b84)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&#10; &lt;g id="rollout-joint-tree-0-agent-icon" class="af-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M0-10v-4"/&gt;&lt;circle cy="-16" r="1.8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="-13" y="-10" width="26" height="22" rx="6"/&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M-13-3h-3v8h3m26-8h3v8h-3M-4 7h8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;circle cx="-5" cy="-2" r="1.3"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="5" cy="-2" r="1.3"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g id="rollout-joint-tree-0-response-icon" class="af-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M-11-15H4l8 8v22h-23ZM4-15v8h8M-5-2H6M-5 4H6M-5 10H2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;/defs&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-edge af-purple" data-rollout-stage="1" data-rollout-kind="edge"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M132 140C174 140 174 86 216 86" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" marker-end="url(#rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-purple)"/&gt;&lt;circle class="af-dot" r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-edge af-teal" data-rollout-stage="1" data-rollout-kind="edge"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M132 140C174 140 174 200 216 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" marker-end="url(#rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-teal)"/&gt;&lt;circle class="af-dot" r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-edge af-purple" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="edge"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M386 86C442 86 454 64 510 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" marker-end="url(#rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-purple)"/&gt;&lt;circle class="af-dot" r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-edge af-purple" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="edge"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M386 86C442 86 454 120 510 120" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" marker-end="url(#rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-purple)"/&gt;&lt;circle class="af-dot" r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-edge af-teal" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="edge"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M386 200C442 200 454 176 510 176" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" marker-end="url(#rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-teal)"/&gt;&lt;circle class="af-dot" r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-edge af-teal" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="edge"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M386 200C442 200 454 232 510 232" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" marker-end="url(#rollout-joint-tree-0-arrow-teal)"/&gt;&lt;circle class="af-dot" r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-neutral" data-rollout-stage="0" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label af-heading" x="301" y="25"&gt;Turn 1&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label af-heading" x="604" y="25"&gt;Next turn&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect class="af-card" x="20" y="98" width="112" height="84" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/&gt;&#10;&lt;use href="#rollout-joint-tree-0-response-icon" x="76" y="126"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label" x="76" y="166"&gt;Task&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-purple" data-rollout-stage="1" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect class="af-card" x="216" y="58" width="170" height="56" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/&gt;&#10;&lt;use href="#rollout-joint-tree-0-response-icon" x="241" y="86"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label" x="315" y="92"&gt;Response A&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-teal" data-rollout-stage="1" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect class="af-card" x="216" y="172" width="170" height="56" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/&gt;&#10;&lt;use href="#rollout-joint-tree-0-response-icon" x="241" y="200"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label" x="315" y="206"&gt;Response B&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-purple" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect class="af-card" x="510" y="43" width="188" height="42" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label" x="604" y="71"&gt;Rollout 1&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-purple" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect class="af-card" x="510" y="99" width="188" height="42" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label" x="604" y="127"&gt;Rollout 2&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-teal" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect class="af-card" x="510" y="155" width="188" height="42" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label" x="604" y="183"&gt;Rollout 3&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-teal" data-rollout-stage="2" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect class="af-card" x="510" y="211" width="188" height="42" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-label" x="604" y="239"&gt;Rollout 4&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="af-node af-neutral" data-rollout-stage="3" data-rollout-kind="node"&gt;&#10; &lt;text class="af-small" x="360" y="275"&gt;Each branch has its own history&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="docs-rollout-controls" hidden&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="docs-rollout-progress"&gt;&#10; &lt;progress data-rollout-progress max="1" value="1" aria-label="Diagram animation progress"&gt;&lt;/progress&gt;&#10; &lt;span data-rollout-status&gt;Complete diagram&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="docs-rollout-actions"&gt;&#10; &lt;button type="button" data-rollout-play aria-label="Play diagram animation"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="docs-rollout-play-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m5 3 7 5-7 5Z" fill="currentColor"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="docs-rollout-pause-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M5.5 3v10m5-10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;span data-rollout-play-label&gt;Play&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button type="button" data-rollout-replay aria-label="Replay diagram animation"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M3.5 5.5a5 5 0 1 1-.3 4M3.5 2.5v3h3"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;span&gt;Replay&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Each episode begins with a task sampled from the dataset, which provides the initial observations &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( \mathbf{o}_0=\{o_{1, 0}, \cdots, o_{n, 0}\} \)&lt;/span&gt; and histories &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( \mathbf{h}_0=\{h_{1, 0}, \cdots, h_{n, 0}\} \)&lt;/span&gt; for all agents. At each turn, agents generate a group of joint responses &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( \mathbf{a}^{\mathcal{G}}_t\gets\boldsymbol{\pi}^{\mathcal{G}}(\cdot|\mathbf{h}_t) \)&lt;/span&gt; from their current observation-action history &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( \mathbf{h}_t \)&lt;/span&gt;. Each response starts a distinct rollout. Agents receive joint rewards &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( r^{(g)}_{t} \)&lt;/span&gt; for each response, based on the accumulated history and current joint action &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( \mathbf{a}^{(g)}_{t} \in \mathbf{a}^{\mathcal{G}}_{t} \)&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;Each rollout then evolves independently&lt;/strong&gt;, producing new joint observations &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( \mathbf{o}^{\mathcal{G}}_{t&amp;#43;1} \)&lt;/span&gt; as the environment evolves and branching into further rollouts at the next turn &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( t&amp;#43;1 \)&lt;/span&gt;. This process continues until the terminal turn &lt;span class="book-katex"&gt;\( H \)&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Environment Transition</title><link>/docs/multi-turn/transition/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/multi-turn/transition/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;External feedback mechanisms control how environment observations are incorporated into prompts for subsequent turns. These mechanisms are usually implemented in CoMLRL&amp;rsquo;s downstream environments.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="docs-rollout" data-feedback-loop data-diagram="environment-transition" data-direction="down" aria-labelledby="rollout-environment-transition-0-title"&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption class="docs-rollout-caption"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="docs-rollout-title" id="rollout-environment-transition-0-title"&gt;Feedback Loop&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="docs-rollout-description docs-sr-only" id="rollout-environment-transition-0-description"&gt;Agents combine their contributions into a response. Tool errors and user hints or new information are routed back to the corresponding agent for the next turn.&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="docs-rollout-stage"&gt;&lt;svg role="img" aria-labelledby="rollout-environment-transition-0-title rollout-environment-transition-0-description" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="720" height="280" viewBox="0 0 720 280"&gt;&#10; &lt;defs&gt;&#10; &lt;marker id="rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-one" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"&gt;&lt;path d="m2 2 5 3-5 3" fill="none" stroke="var(--flow-one)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&#10; &lt;marker id="rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-two" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"&gt;&lt;path d="m2 2 5 3-5 3" fill="none" stroke="var(--flow-two)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&#10; &lt;marker id="rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-three" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"&gt;&lt;path d="m2 2 5 3-5 3" fill="none" stroke="var(--flow-three)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&#10; &lt;marker id="rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-neutral" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"&gt;&lt;path d="m2 2 5 3-5 3" fill="none" stroke="var(--flow-muted)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&#10; &lt;g id="rollout-environment-transition-0-agent-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M0-10v-4"/&gt;&lt;circle cy="-16" r="1.8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="-13" y="-10" width="26" height="22" rx="6"/&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M-13-3h-3v8h3m26-8h3v8h-3M-4 7h8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;circle cx="-5" cy="-2" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="5" cy="-2" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;/defs&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;!-- Contributions move left to right; matching feedback returns along the lower lanes. --&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-one" data-flow-edge="compose"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M168 62C204 62 198 106 234 106" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-one)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-two" data-flow-edge="compose"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M168 126H234" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-two)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-three" data-flow-edge="compose"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M168 190C204 190 198 146 234 146" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-three)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-neutral" data-flow-edge="respond"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M340 108C370 108 370 73 400 73" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-neutral)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-neutral" data-flow-edge="respond"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M340 144C370 144 370 179 400 179" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-neutral)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-neutral" data-flow-edge="respond" data-flow-delay="0.45"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M542 73C574 73 572 113 604 113" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-neutral)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-neutral" data-flow-edge="respond" data-flow-delay="0.45"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M542 179C574 179 572 139 604 139" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-neutral)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-return flow-one" data-flow-edge="route"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M625 142V224Q625 236 613 236H26Q14 236 14 224V74Q14 62 26 62H50" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-0-arrow-one)"/&gt;&lt;circle r="3.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/g&gt;&#10; &lt;g class="flow-edge flow-return flow-two" data-flow-edge="route"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M649 142V238Q649 250 637 250H38Q26 250 26 238V138Q26 126 38 126H50" marker-end="url(#rollout-environment-transition-